        "granularity": "Each independently authored original action, Unicode scalar match and event argument; each complete named source/seed frozen/current process; complete unchanged permanent private-provenance TAP plans. Broader consumer/render observations are separately disclosed below.",
        "result": "Nine PrimitiveBasicRules regex contracts retain original scalar match positions privately. 9 authored sources/27 seed-bound before/after compiler pairs preserve public event/raw/argument, substitution, diagnostic, dump and emission records. 81 origins satisfy independent positions. The same complete ten-group test fails nine before and passes ten after; the empty-result guard passes both. 12 evidence corruptions reject."
      },
